<title>INDIA: INDIA COLGATE FINAL DIV AT 1.3 RUPEES.</title>
<headline>INDIA COLGATE FINAL DIV AT 1.3 RUPEES.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's leading toothpaste maker Colgate-Palmolive Ltd said on Tuesday its board recommended a final dividend of 1.3 rupees a share for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
